OL,3,GNEWSADrug dealer jailed for county
OL,4,Alines operation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA drug dealer who transported thousands
OL,7,Fof pounds worth of crack cocaine and
OL,8,Fheroin between North and West Yorkshire
OL,9,Fhas been jailed.
OL,11,FDakari Roy Brown, 25, who operated the
OL,12,F"Larry Line" between York and
OL,13,FHuddersfield, was sentenced to five
OL,14,Fyears and seven months imprisonment at
OL,15,FYork Crown Court on Thursday.
OL,17,FBrown, of Bulay Road in Huddersfield,
OL,18,Fhad previously admitted conspiracy to
OL,19,Fsupply cocaine, conspiracy to supply
OL,20,Fheroin, and acquire, use or possess
OL,21,Fcriminal property.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
