OL,3,GNEWSADrug dealer jailed for county
OL,4,Alines operation
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking after the hearing, a
OL,7,Fspokesperson for North Yorkshire Police
OL,8,Fsaid county lines drug dealers like
OL,9,FBrown "exploit some of the most
OL,10,Fvulnerable people in our communities to
OL,11,Fmake as much money as possible".
